---
// The ampersand from the Sweet & Fizzy logo, drawn large for the home header:
// the white glyph with the logo's own blue, yellow and orange offset shapes.
// White glyph from public/img/logo.svg; colored shapes from SNF-w&.svg (Nov 2026),
// shifted into logo coordinates. Both outlines were smoothed (Nov 2026) to remove
// tracing bumps. The colored shapes sit behind the glyph with a thin stroke in
// their own color, so their inner edges tuck under the white with no seams.
// Where a color leaves the white, a straight line tangent to both (in the
// direction of the 3D offset) joins them: each amp-cut mask trims the color past
// that line and the small polygons fill the gap inside it. The yellow's bottom
// and right edges follow the curl's own outline, shifted by the 3D offset.
---
